# tab-series-short (M8; the M5b review's carry-over): the short window (1100 x 720), whose panel
# scrolls (610 px of 719 show). Tab brings a stop its panel hides into view as WebKit and Chromium
# do (their CenterIfNeeded): P's track (711.5..731.5, hidden under 703) would come to the panel's
# middle, which the panel can't reach, so it goes to its foot (109); the plane shows the plane's keys
# under the cards, mostly hidden at that scroll. Shift+Tab back through the stops: the track and the
# boxes show at 109; the picker (164..198, hidden above at 109) brings the panel back to its top.
# Judged against Chromium (its Tab order, call 3 f).
size 1100 720
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
wait 16
tab
wait 16
